      "notes": "## What's new in 1.0.0-rc17\n\n- **Restart button for a device that needs a reboot.** The node Updates banner and Settings > Updates notice now open a Restart dialog that lists what is running and asks for the device name before rebooting, instead of sending you to the Power page.\n\n**Full changelog:** https://github.com/OpenSourcx/papercliped-engine/compare/v1.0.0-rc16...v1.0.0-rc17\n",
